ed DemoNet-B ledger for every participant."}, {"id": "2", "label": "2", "text": "The descriptions separate asset, network record, interface and account service."}, {"id": "3", "label": "3", "text": "A service's display name identifies the native fee asset."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "2", "feedback": "C: DEMO-UNIT is the asset, DemoNet-B the ledger/network, HorizonView the interface, LandingBox the service. All four labels must be correct."}, {"id": "KC01B-2", "outcomes": ["O-01.2"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "LandingBox credit establishes authorisation before DemoNet-B processes the request."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Opening HorizonView establishes both the network event and receiving credit."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Authorisation precedes network processing; provider credit is a separate stage."}], "reasons": [{"id": "1", "label": "1", "text": "Permission to attempt an action differs from network and service outcomes."}, {"id": "2", "label": "2", "text": "The visible request establishes receiving credit because the recipient is accessible."}, {"id": "3", "label": "3", "text": "Provider balances replace all network processing."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "1", "feedback": "C: Authorisation is a permission stage, not network completion or provider credit. Identify the later participants separately."}, {"id": "KC01B-3", "outcomes": ["O-01.2"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "An internal credit must be a fresh public transfer."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "LandingBox can update its account record after its own checks."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "LandingBox's account record is necessarily the DemoNet-B ledger."}], "reasons": [{"id": "1", "label": "1", "text": "All providers share one internal accounting system."}, {"id": "