ncluded but its execution failed: zero DEMO-TOKEN moved and 0.03 DEMO-GAS was charged. Record R was rejected before submission/inclusion for missing required data; this specific fixture explicitly records zero network fee.</p>", "items": [{"id": "K6A1", "outcomes": ["O-06.1"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Accept X on matching amount/network/memo despite the destination."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Pause X and reconcile its recipient/full-destination mismatch."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Use X's memo as confirmation of the intended recipient."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Amount and network establish the intended destination."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Matching memo establishes the displayed recipient's identity."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The recipient/destination conflict with independently supplied intent."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "X's recipient/full destination conflict with intent. Amount, network and memo do not erase the mismatch."}, {"id": "K6A2", "outcomes": ["O-06.1"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Confirm Y's recipient/token/network/destination/amount/required memo."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Confirm Y's recipient/token/network and destination suffix only."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Confirm Y's recipient/token/network/amount without required memo."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "All supplied required request and destination fields agree."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Matching destination suffix establishes the complete receiving route."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "A matching ticker makes the supplied memo unnecessary."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Check all six stated details, not an address suffi