nd what they prove", "fixture_html": "<p>Mapped outcomes: O-07.1–O-07.4. Required: K7A1–K7A8.</p>\n<p>Fixture: These stages belong to a supplied route and need separate records: sender Submitted means broadcast attempted; explorer Pending means successful inclusion is not yet shown; explorer Failed means included execution failed; explorer Successful with confirmations records that network event; independently reached provider Credited records an account credit; independently reached local receiving account Paid out/Received records local receipt. Not every real route uses these exact labels.</p>\n<p>Route intended: 18 DEMO-TOKEN, DemoNet-S, transaction <code>DEMO-TX-71</code>, from <code>DEMO-SENDER-71</code> to <code>DEMO-RECEIVER-71</code>. Explorer record E matches all fields, status Successful, three confirmations, fee 0.02 DEMO-GAS. Its separate Finality field is “not yet finalised under DemoNet-S rule”. Provider's supplied rule requires at least five confirmations, then processing review; credit is established only by a matching Credited entry. Provider currently shows Pending review; no local payout record is supplied. Record W has transaction <code>DEMO-TX-72</code> on DemoNet-T with the same visible amount but another destination. In choices, TX71/TX72/Sender71/Receiver71 abbreviate the corresponding supplied DEMO references. All explorer fields here are publicly visible mock information; provider account and local bank records are private. No record contains recovery material.</p>", "items": [{"id": "K7A1", "outcomes": ["O-07.1"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Treat the six labels as different names for completion."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Distinguish sender/network/provider/local receipt across the six supplied labels."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Treat pending/failed labels as completed local-payout processing."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The submitted broadcast establishes receiving-account credit."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Successful inclusion establishes both downstream receiving stages."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The labels identify distinct stages and record authorities."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "Distinguish all six supplied labels and record authorities. Real interfaces may label them differently."}, {"id": "K7A2", "outcomes": ["O-07.1"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Report network success; provider credit/local payout unconfirmed."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Report network success and local payout; provider credit inferred."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Report submitted only; disregard the matching successful network record."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Matching explorer establishes success; account credit/payout remain unconfirmed."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Matching successful amount establishes the provider's credited balance."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Public successful record establishes the local receiving-account balance."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Network success is established; provider credit and bank/mobile-money payout are not."}, {"id": "K7A3", "outcomes": ["O-07.2"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Treat three confirmations as this network's finalised state."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Treat the finality field as completed local payout."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Separate confirmations, stated not-finalised status and provider acceptance."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The provider's threshold defines protocol finality here."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The supplied network-finality and provider-credit tests are distinct."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The confirmation count is the local receiving-account balance."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Confirmation count, specified network finality and provider acceptance differ. Do not teach five as a universal finality threshold."}, {"id": "K7A4", "outcomes": ["O-07.2"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Treat confirmation five as completed provider credit."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Require threshold plus processing/Credited evidence; retain timing uncertainty."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Accept three confirmations in place of the stated five."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The minimum does not establish completed processing or timing."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The threshold alone establishes completed provider processing."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The sender estimate supersedes the provider's receiving rule."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Three is below five; even at five the supplied later processing/Credited record is required. No exact deadline follows."}, {"id": "K7A5", "outcomes": ["O-07.3"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Read DemoNet-S/TX71/Sender71/Receiver71/18 tokens/Successful/0.02 DEMO-GAS."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Read DemoNet-T/TX72/Sender71/Receiver71/18 tokens/Paid out/0.02 DEMO-GAS."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Read DemoNet-S/TX71/Sender71/Receiver71/18.02 tokens/Successful/zero DEMO-GAS."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Matching amount makes W the intended transaction record."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The fee uses the same asset as the transferred amount."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "E's fields match the intended event; amount/fee units differ."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "Read all named fields correctly;18 DEMO-TOKEN and 0.02 DEMO-GAS cannot be added into 18.02 tokens."}, {"id": "K7A6", "outcomes": ["O-07.3"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Use W because its amount matches the intended 18."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Use W after omitting its network and destination fields."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Exclude W; match intended network/reference/destination independently."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "W's network, reference and destination differ from intent."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The amount identifies this payment independently of network/reference."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The sender screenshot substitutes for W's mismatched destination."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Wrong network, reference and destination prevent treating W as this route's record."}, {"id": "K7A7", "outcomes": ["O-07.4"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Treat unnamed addresses as sufficient anonymity protection."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Recognise public linkage risk; exclude secrets/private account details."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Share recovery material to authenticate the public receipt."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The public address hides associations with other transactions."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Public history may link pseudonymous addresses to people."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Recovery material is the receiving-account's payment evidence."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Public addresses/amounts/history may link to identity; private account records and secrets should not be publicly posted."}, {"id": "K7A8", "outcomes": ["O-07.4"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Keep scoped route/status/amount/fee/receipt records privately, without secrets."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Keep the sender image alone, excluding references and units."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Publish account documents/recovery backups alongside the explorer receipt."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Scoped records support matching/reconciliation without exposing secrets."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Shared recovery backups establish the correct receiving stage."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The cropped sender image supplies independent receiving verification."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Preserve useful appropriately private records and units, without claiming a legal retention duration or collecting secrets."}], "outcomes": ["O-07.1", "O-07.2", "O-07.3", "O-07.4"], "prerequisites": [], "revision": "1", "approved": false}, {"id": "KC-07-B", "canonical_id": "KC-07", "kind": "check", "form": "B", "module_id": "M-07", "title": "Retry with credit and receipt genuinely established", "fixture_html": "<p>Mapped outcomes: O-07.1–O-07.4. Required: K7B1–K7B8.</p>\n<p>Fixture: Sender Submitted and explorer Pending describe an earlier attempt <code>DEMO-TX-OLD</code>. A separate included-failed record <code>DEMO-TX-FAIL</code> transferred zero tokens and charged 0.015 DEMO-GAS. The completed route is 22 DEMO-TOKEN on DemoNet-U, transaction <code>DEMO-TX-73</code>, from <code>DEMO-SENDER-73</code> to <code>DEMO-RECEIVER-73</code>, network fee 0.025 DEMO-GAS. Its matching explorer shows Successful, six confirmations and “Finalised under the supplied DemoNet-U rule”. Provider policy requires four confirmations plus completed processing; its independently opened entry says Credited 22 DEMO-TOKEN for TX73. A separately matched payout reference <code>DEMO-PAYOUT-73</code> and independently opened local receiving account show Received 3,100 DEMO-LOCAL. In choices, TX73/Sender73/Receiver73/OTHER73 abbreviate the supplied DEMO references. No completion-time promise is supplied. Record Z instead has TX73-shaped text on DemoNet-V with destination <code>DEMO-OTHER-73</code>; matching visible identifier text alone does not make it this event.</p>", "items": [{"id": "K7B1", "outcomes": ["O-07.1"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Keep earlier submitted/pending/failed attempts distinct from the completed route."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Apply the latest local receipt to the earlier attempt records."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Keep the completed credited route classified as submitted only."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The failed attempt has become the later successful event."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Different references preserve separately evidenced stages and outcomes."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The bank receipt changes the outcome of earlier attempts."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Separate earlier attempts and all six stage categories rather than rewriting old outcomes after a later success."}, {"id": "K7B2", "outcomes": ["O-07.1"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Treat payout as unconfirmed despite independent local receiving evidence."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Treat explorer success alone as proof of the local receipt."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Recognise network/credit/local receipt from their matching separate records."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Account and receiving evidence establish what the explorer cannot."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The confirmations alone establish the private receiving-account balance."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The private account records add no evidence beyond the explorer."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Recognise genuinely established receipt based on independent matched records. The explorer alone still cannot prove it."}, {"id": "K7B3", "outcomes": ["O-07.2"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Use six confirmations as the finality rule for another network."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Separate this stated finality state from provider acceptance/local receipt."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Interpret the finality label as the network-fee amount."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Network-specific state and account/receipt records establish different facts."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The provider processing rule defines the protocol's finality state."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "This confirmation count establishes a network-independent finality rule."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "The explicit current mock finality rule, provider acceptance and local receipt remain separate. No universal confirmation count."}, {"id": "K7B4", "outcomes": ["O-07.2"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Recognise threshold/processing/Credited evidence here; promise no fixed time."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Apply the earlier five-confirmation condition to this four-confirmation policy."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Replace provider processing with the protocol's finality field alone."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The previous form's policy remains applicable to this network."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Current policy and matching processing govern this credit."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Network finality records the provider's internal account-balance update."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Six≥four plus matching Credited processing supports credit here. Do not reuse form A's five-confirmation fixture as a global rule."}, {"id": "K7B5", "outcomes": ["O-07.3"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Read DemoNet-U/TX73/Sender73/Receiver73/22.025 tokens/Successful/zero gas; local 3,100."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Read DemoNet-V/TX73/Sender73/OTHER73/22 tokens/Successful/0.025 gas; local 3,100."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Read DemoNet-U/TX73/Sender73/Receiver73/22 tokens/Successful/0.025 gas; separate local 3,100."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The network amount, gas fee and local receipt are separate facts."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "No conversion rate is needed to merge these three asset units."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Similar reference text establishes one event across the two networks."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Correctly identify every explorer field and its units; local 3,100 requires the separate receiving record."}, {"id": "K7B6", "outcomes": ["O-07.3"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Accept Z despite the alternate network and receiving destination."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Exclude Z because its network/destination differ from intent."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Use Z's reference text alone to establish local payout."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The matching amount corrects the receiving-destination mismatch."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The reference text identifies the event independent of its network."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Matching requires network/reference/intended destination rather than appearance."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "Z does not match this route despite similar identifier text."}, {"id": "K7B7", "outcomes": ["O-07.4"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Keep secrets/private documents private; recognise public-history linkage risk."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Treat absence of personal names as adequate anonymity evidence."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Attach recovery material as the proof of receiving authority."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Secret material is needed to match the payment record."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Useful receipt records need no secrets and may expose relationships."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Unnamed explorer entries cannot be associated with a person's account."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Reject secret disclosure/anonymity promises, preserving public/private evidence distinctions."}, {"id": "K7B8", "outcomes": ["O-07.4"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Keep sender assertion alone; discard the matching payout reference."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Post complete private statements to authenticate the receipt publicly."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Keep scoped network/provider/payout records and redacted receipts privately."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Scoped references support reconciliation while reducing unnecessary exposure."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The easier unrelated screenshot establishes the same receiving evidence."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Public unredacted statements are required to establish private receipt."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Keep scoped useful references and appropriate private/redacted receipts. No legal retention policy is established."}], "outcomes": ["O-07.1", "O-07.2", "O-07.3", "O-07.4"], "prerequisites": [], "revision": "1", "approved": false}, {"id": "PM-07-A", "canonical_id": "PM-07", "kind": "mission", "form": "A", "module_id": "M-07", "title": "Reconcile four attempts and preserve evidence", "fixture_html": "<p>Mapped outcomes: O-07.1–O-07.4. Gate: <strong>none; open read-only mock-record exercise</strong>. Required: P7A1–P7A6.</p>\n<p>Intended route: 26 DEMO-TOKEN, DemoNet-W, from <code>DEMO-SENDER-74</code> to <code>DEMO-RECEIVER-74</code>. Provider policy: at least five confirmations then processing; only a matching Credited record establishes account credit. Each attempt has its own reference:</p>", "items": [{"id": "P7A1", "outcomes": ["O-07.1"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Classify pending/failed/rejected attempts as locally paid out."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Distinguish A pending, C included failure/fee and D unsubmitted/zero fee."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Classify A as successful and C/D as account credited."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The two unsuccessful interfaces necessarily share a fee rule."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The submitted label establishes completed network processing."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Distinct attempt records establish different stages and costs."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "Distinguish submitted/pending, included failed and unsubmitted rejection; apply their explicit fees without universalising them."}, {"id": "P7A2", "outcomes": ["O-07.1", "O-07.2"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Recognise B success/account credit; retain unconfirmed local payout."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Treat B's supplied matching credit as only a sender assertion."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Infer local payout from B's five confirmations alone."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Matching account evidence establishes credit, separately from local receipt."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Five confirmations establish protocol finality and bank receipt together."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The credited account entry adds no independent receiving evidence."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Positive provider credit is established in B by its separate record; screenshot-only bank payout is not."}, {"id": "P7A3", "outcomes": ["O-07.2"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Treat five confirmations as B's finalised network state."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Separate B's not-finalised field from account credit; promise no time."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Use B's provider credit to override the protocol finality field."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The provider's processing threshold defines network finality here."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The protocol and provider apply separate supplied conditions."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Reaching the minimum establishes an exact processing deadline."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Provider can credit under its supplied rule while this network's stated finality field remains not finalised; no universal rule/time inferred."}, {"id": "P7A4", "outcomes": ["O-07.3"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Use B's matching amount and sender bank-paid image as local receiving evidence."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Read DemoNet-W/TX74B/Sender74/Receiver74/26.03 tokens/Successful/zero gas as local payout."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Read DemoNet-W/TX74B/Sender74/Receiver74/26 tokens/Successful/0.03 gas; independently verify local payout."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The explorer establishes network event/cost; the image is sender evidence."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Different asset units may be combined without a conversion rate."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The screenshot supplies the receiving-account's independently checked status."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Match all listed fields; do not add token/gas units or use a sender screenshot as independent receipt."}, {"id": "P7A5", "outcomes": ["O-07.4"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Reject secret disclosure/anonymity claims; recognise public-identity linkage risk."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Share recovery material to let the provider authenticate B."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Treat pseudonymous sender labels as sufficient anonymity evidence."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Recovery access establishes whether the recipient's bank was paid."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The pseudonymous label prevents association with a real account."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Receipts need no secrets; public history exposes relationships."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "No secret disclosure/anonymity guarantee. Account statements need privacy-aware handling separate from public explorer fields."}, {"id": "P7A6", "outcomes": ["O-07.3", "O-07.4"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Omit C's fee because its intended token transfer failed."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Privately retain distinct attempt/cost/provider/payout records with units."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Use the sender image alone and share unredacted account statements."}], "reasons": [{"