me or reversibility is stated. All explorer fields are public mock data; payout/account documents are private; no real credentials are supplied.</p>", "items": [{"id": "P7B1", "outcomes": ["O-07.1"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Preserve pending/included-failed/unsubmitted/successful attempts and stated costs."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Apply 4,600 received locally to the earlier attempts."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Keep the completed route classified as submitted only."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The later successful event revises the earlier fee entries."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Separate references preserve the actual stages, inclusion and outcomes."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Local receipt establishes that the earlier included failure succeeded."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Preserve all six relevant stage categories and the explicit inclusion/fee differences across attempts."}, {"id": "P7B2", "outcomes": ["O-07.1", "O-07.3"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Infer the local 4,600 receipt from the explorer alone."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Treat the independently matched local receipt as still unavailable."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Recognise success/credit/local receipt from matching separate records."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The account/payout/receiving records establish separate receiving stages."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "A matching 32-token explorer amount establishes the fiat receipt."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The sender assertion has the same authority as the receiving account."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Correct positive local receipt comes from separate independently matched account records, not the explorer alone."}, {"id": "P7B3", "outcomes": ["O-07.2"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Replace this two-confirmation policy with the earlier five."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Apply this threshold/processing rule; separate finality/credit/receipt without timing promise."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Use the Finalised label to establish completed local receipt."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The earlier network's threshold remains applicable to this provider."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The finality field records the provider's internal account balance."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The current protocol/provider facts establish separate conditions."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "Four≥two plus Credited processing is satisfied here; actual finality and local receipt still have their own records. No universal counts/times."}, {"id": "P7B4", "outcomes": ["O-07.3"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Exclude WRONG75; read DemoNet-X/TX75/Sender75/Receiver75/32 tokens/Successful/0.022 DEMO-GAS."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Accept WRONG75; read DemoNet-Y/TX75/Sender75/OTHER75/32 tokens/Successful/0.022 DEMO-GAS."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Use TX75; read DemoNet-X/TX75/Sender75/Receiver75/32.022 tokens/Successful/zero DEMO-GAS."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Evidence matching requires relevant fields and their stated units."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The amount identifies the payment independently of destination/network."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Similar reference text corrects the alternate receiving destination."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Reject wrong-network/destination evidence and preserve amount/fee uni