: false}, {"id": "KC-08-A", "canonical_id": "KC-08", "kind": "check", "form": "A", "module_id": "M-08", "title": "Classify authority and combine the decision", "fixture_html": "<p>Mapped outcomes: O-08.1–O-08.4. Required: K8A1–K8A8.</p>\n<p>Fixture: In this explicitly supplied token/account model, Connect shares an address and lets a site request future actions; connection alone grants no spending permission. Message M signs a readable login challenge for DEMO-BOOK, with its specified domain and nonce and no spending authority under this model. Permit P is also signed with no immediate network fee, but explicitly authorises spender <code>DEMO-SPENDER-P</code> to take up to 500 DEMO-TOKEN until its stated deadline. Approve A is a separate network transaction granting spender <code>DEMO-SPENDER-A</code> up to 20 DEMO-TOKEN. Transfer T directly sends 12 DEMO-TOKEN to <code>DEMO-RECEIVER-81</code> on DemoNet-Z. Action names alone do not establish what actual payloads authorise.</p>\n<p>The current task is reading a public article; no connection, signature, approval or transfer is needed. A pre-existing permission to DEMO-SPENDER-P remains 500 tokens. Disconnect removes the site's current connection, but this supplied model leaves that permission in force. Its verified permission-management view can submit a revocation transaction setting that allowance to zero after successful inclusion. Revocation can consume a network fee; it does not reverse past transfers. The model also allows separately signed, unused permits; revoking a recorded allowance does not establish cancellation of every separately signed authority. No such permit-cancellation method is supplied here.</p>\n<p>For the combined route, independent receiving instructions support exact DEMO-TOKEN on DemoNet-Z to DEMO-RECEIVER-81 with required memo <code>DEMO-MEMO-81</code>,12 tokens. Sender has 20 tokens and 0.10 DEMO-GAS; estimated network fee 0.03 DEMO-GAS is extra sender-paid. Mock explorer shows matching Successful 12-token transfer, but provider is still Pending and no local receiving record exists. The unrelated “reader reward” Permit P remains unnecessary.</p>", "items": [{"id": "K8A1", "outcomes": ["O-08.1"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Distinguish connection, supplied login signature, allowance transaction and transfer."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Classify each displayed request as immediate asset transfer."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Classify each signature request as connection with read-only access."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The interface label establishes the actual requested authority."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The supplied payloads distinguish the action/authority types."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The connection request itself supplies private-key disclosure."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Classify each supplied actual request, including ordinary message signature versus spending permission/transfer. No generalisation that all message signatures are harmless."}, {"id": "K8A2", "outcomes": ["O-08.1"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Accept P as non-spending because signing has no immediate fee."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Classify P as the same login authority as M."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Identify P's spending authority; decline it for article reading."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "P grants spending authority unnecessary for article reading."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Absence of a fee establishes the signature's non-spending scope."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The reward label restricts P to a session-login challenge."}], "answer_action": "C", "answer_reason": "A", "feedback": "Signed Permit P grants spending authority without immediate fee; refuse for article reading."}, {"id": "K8A3", "outcomes": ["O-08.2"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Use P's deadline alone to validate its spender/limit."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Identify spender/asset/500 limit/deadline; refuse unrelated scope."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Treat P's 500 limit as the intended 12-token transfer."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "The deadline bounds the authority to one 12-token payment."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "The spending limit is the network-fee amount."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The supplied authority exceeds and does not serve this task."}], "answer_action": "B", "answer_reason": "C", "feedback": "Name spender, asset, limit and deadline/scope; task mismatch is essential even when request is well formed."}, {"id": "K8A4", "outcomes": ["O-08.2"], "class": "E", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Require task-matched spender/asset/limit; decline unrelated reading permission."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Use the site's logo to validate its spender and scope."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "Treat unused signatures as irrelevant because funds have not moved."}], "reasons": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "No transfer yet establishes that future authority is absent."}, {"id": "B", "label": "B", "text": "Actual task/scope matching matters; logo and timing do not suffice."}, {"id": "C", "label": "C", "text": "The signature's display label establishes its requested limit."}], "answer_action": "A", "answer_reason": "B", "feedback": "Check independently explained relevant scope; no logo/no-transfer shortcut."}, {"id": "K8A5", "outcomes": ["O-08.3"], "class": "C", "prompt": "Choose the finding or action and its reason.", "actions": [{"id": "A", "label": "A", "text": "Treat Disconnect as